# CoNLL-U, as the tree-sitter-conllu grammar gives it.
grammar conllu
resolve lines
records sentence
columns id field under word_line tier 1 fields ID FORM LEMMA UPOS XPOS FEATS HEAD DEPREL DEPS MISC
node document group
node sentence group as record
node comment note name key text value
node word_line group as row
node id text
node field text field FEATS grammar kv_pipe
node field text field DEPREL grammar ud_relation
node field text field DEPS grammar deps
node field text field MISC grammar ud_misc
node field text raw
